    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Lists\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Learn:** Ask the AI Tutor: \"How do lists work in HTML?\". _Tip: You can type your question or highlight lines of code and select **\"Add to AI Tutor\"**._\r\n2. **Create:** Tell the AI to add new content using precise words\r\n    - Example: *\"Add an unordered list so that...\"*\r\n\r\nOnce you’ve added your new content and accepted the changes, click **Continue**.",
