        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>Different ways to say Hello:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Hello</li>\n      <li>Hola</li>\n      <li>Bonjour</li>\n      <li>Gutentag</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>How to bake a cake:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C).</li>\n      <li>Mix dry ingredients in a large bowl.</li>\n      <li>Add wet ingredients and mix until smooth.</li>\n      <li>Pour batter into a greased pan.</li>\n      <li>Bake for 30-40 minutes.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    \n  </body>\n</html>\n  ",
          "active": true,
